---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Use — GOATSBattle" description="The terms that apply when using GOATSBattle.">
  <section class="page-container py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-lime">Effective 13 July 2026</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-headline font-black uppercase text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-ink">Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 font-sans text-body leading-relaxed">By using GOATSBattle, you agree to these terms and the community rules.</p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 font-sans text-body leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-black uppercase text-2xl text-ink">Accounts</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">You must provide accurate account information, keep access to your sign-in method secure, and take responsibility for activity performed through your account. You may read public pages without an account; voting and discussion actions require authentication.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-black uppercase text-2xl text-ink">Your content</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">You retain ownership of content you submit. You grant GOATSBattle a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free licence to host, reproduce, display, and distribute that content as needed to operate and promote the service. Do not submit content you lack the right to share.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-black uppercase text-2xl text-ink">Acceptable use</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">You may not abuse, disrupt, scrape at harmful volume, bypass access controls, manipulate votes, impersonate others, publish unlawful material, or use the service to harass or threaten people. We may remove content or restrict accounts when reasonably necessary to protect the service or community.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-black uppercase text-2xl text-ink">Sports data and availability</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">Fixtures, scores, statistics, and status information may be delayed, incomplete, or corrected. GOATSBattle is a discussion product, not an official competition record or betting service. The service is provided “as is” and may change or become unavailable without notice.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-black uppercase text-2xl text-ink">Liability</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">To the fullest extent permitted by law, GOATSBattle is not liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from use of the service. Nothing here excludes rights or liability that cannot legally be excluded.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-black uppercase text-2xl text-ink">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">Questions about these terms may be sent to <a class="text-lime hover:underline" href="mailto:contact@goatsbattle.com">contact@goatsbattle.com</a>.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
